  [already_present] claude-spend-separate-figure/is-claude-prefix-match-too-narrow
    candidate edits: 1 asked for, 0 set aside, none used
    pairs: 0 settled by the run, 4 put to the model, 0 dropped as not worth asking, 237 skipped once the defect was covered
    Line 190 does the DEFECTIVE behaviour: it takes the last '/'-segment and uses a case-sensitive startswith('claude'). Names like 'anthropic.claude-...' or 'Claude-...' are not matched. The repair matches 'claude' case-insensitively anywhere in the name, regardless of prefix or separator. Non-str models are still excluded, and voyage names do not contain 'claude'.

